{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124363","id":4815690343,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABHwmaZw","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124363","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124363.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124363.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124363","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124363/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124363/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124363/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/bbfd1b759ff7066b7da27f848c094642c4ebc8dd","number":124363,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"[Core] Migrate `Variant` method binding to `GDType` and unify with `Object` approach","user":{"login":"StarryWorm","id":41305715,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxMzA1NzE1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41305715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm","html_url":"https://github.com/StarryWorm","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Follow-up to #117451\r\n- Work towards https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/13216\r\n- Inadvertently closes #118184, superseding #118290\r\n- Requires #124362 (squashed into one commit in this PR for simplicity)\r\n\r\nAs the next step in the unification journey, `Variant` method bindings are migrated to `GDType`. In order to achieve this, they are switched from using the internal `VariantBuiltInMethodInfo` `struct` to using `MethodBind` like everyone else. \r\n\r\nThis greatly simplifies the `variant_call.cpp` implementation, thereby reducing code by 477 lines or 16%. This does come at a cost in `method_bind_common.h` where 224 LOC are added, reducing the benefits from #124362.\r\n\r\nAs a side bonus due to using `MethodBind`, any method inspecting these bindings gains access to richer information. This is taken advantage of (purely by accident) by the doctool, thereby closing #118184. Documentation descriptions were updated to reflect the fact that the returns/parameters now link correctly, and thus not needing manual linking to the associated Enum in the method description. \r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nIt is technically possible to achieve this migration without #124362, as was done in v2: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/compare/master...StarryWorm:godot:unified-methods-v2. That approach, however, requires more code and is less elegant. \r\n\r\n> Draft until the required PR is merged. This PR is technically ready for review and fully functional as is.\r\n\r\n> AI disclosure: A vast majority (95%+) of the code was written by me. AI use was limited to bug fixing at the intersection of templates+macros, things like a missing `&` or `*`.\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node